        <mxCell id="domain_notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading this view&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;− private attribute; + public operation. Parameter types are abbreviated.&lt;br/&gt;Association-end numbers state how many instances may be related.&lt;br/&gt;Only selected members are shown; getters, setters and constructors are mostly omitted.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation boundaries&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Roles are UserRole values, not User subclasses. A built-in FloorPlan may have no organiser. Event stores category, venueName and city as text; it has no Venue association. EventSeat has no stored Seat reference.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Pending/cancelled bookings may have no linked EventSeat or Ticket. Confirmation links the sold seats and issues one Ticket per seat. Booking.seatIds separately records the selected IDs before confirmation." vertex="1" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;strokeColor=#334155;shape=note;fillColor=#FFFDF2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=17;">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="940" y="875" width="830" height="280" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
