        <mxCell id="app_notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Scope&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;All services and the scheduled job are shown. Members are selective; … abbreviates parameters.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Controllers delegate to services; repositories persist the domain objects in panel A. DTOs cross HTTP boundaries.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Hollow triangles denote interface realisation. Mock is the default payment mode. Stripe confirms by webhook.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;JavaMailSender is optional. Email is skipped without mail configuration." vertex="1" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;strokeColor=#334155;shape=note;fillColor=#FFFDF2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=16;">
